  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A leather belt of small glass vials, each a different color and none of them labeled. The vials clink against each other in a pattern that is almost a tune, and they are never quite full.</p><p><strong>Drink a Vial.</strong> As a Bonus Action, you drink one of the bandolier's vials and choose an ability. For 1 hour that ability score increases by 2, to a maximum of 24, and you have Advantage on checks with it. The bandolier holds three vials and they refill at dawn; a second vial ends the first.</p><p><strong>The Change Shows.</strong> For as long as a vial lasts, the drinker looks the part: taller and heavier for Strength, quick-eyed for Wisdom, impossible to ignore for Charisma. People who meet the drinker then do not recognize them afterward.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
